  ✅ [E-1] crash after reserve → reconcile, no advance
  ✅ [E-2] final commit persist failure checked
  ✅ [E-3] committed beat not rerun after restart
  ✅ [E-4] committed advances exactly once
  ✅ [۹] persist failure → block commit, no advance
  ✅ [P] production-safe forbids ACT/LEARN
  ✅ [۸] watchdog stall detection
  ✅ [۱] ترتیبِ فازِ قطعی
  ✅ [۲] every_n_beats
  ✅ [۳] bounded + circuit breaker
  ✅ [۴] organ failure isolation
  ✅ [۵] restart continuity (beatِ بعدی، نه دوباره)
  ✅ [۶] HALT — فقط فازهای امن
  ✅ [۷] zero double-actuation (ACT dry-run)
